  "metadata": {
    "alignment": "unspecified",
    "description": "0xSero's a0 baseline of GLM-5.3-Flash EXL3 on one Spark with SGLang, the default profile of glm-5.3-flash-spark-mosaic at 248dbaa0 (docker/run-spark.sh; the same image and launch as recipe A of 0xSero/GLM-5.3-Flash-DGX-Spark): turboderp's 2.05 bpw quantization (codebook mul1, 85.2 GB, branch 2.05bpw) served through upstream's exl3-plain SGLang overlay image (pinned by digest, built on the lmsysorg glm-5.3-flash base) with DSA attention, FP8 E4M3 KV cache, 262144-token context, up to 16 concurrent requests, image input, glm45 reasoning and glm47 tool parsers. CUDA graphs are off and there is no speculative decoding. Upstream's census of the tensors runs first at container start and stops the launch on a layout mismatch. Upstream claims, not measured here: 78.9 percent top-1 agreement with BF16 (KL 0.384) and retrieval at 262016 tokens; 9 to 10 tok/s decode for the turboderp mul1 lineage at 262144-token class context (the upstream lineage table, which covers this baseline and the mosaic). Licences are informational: repository and weights are MIT. Physical Spark acceptance is pending.",
